+<header class="kit-page-header__root" data-mode="compiled" data-comp="page-header · pattern · pop"><p class="kit-page-header__eyebrow">Docket · how the trail is made</p><h1 class="kit-page-header__title">How to read this</h1><p class="kit-page-header__question"><strong>Question.</strong> Is what I am reading recorded evidence, and how can I check it myself?</p><p class="kit-page-header__answer">Every value is labelled generated, recorded or written, so you can see who produced it. This snapshot was compiled from origin/main b394466 at 2026-10-19 17:45:08 UTC, and the git commands below re-check the order from a clone.</p><dl class="kit-page-header__meta"><div class="kit-page-header__field"><dt>Gaps</dt><dd><span class="kit-status-tag__tag kit-status-tag__warn" data-status="warn"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle kit-status-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span>Warn 2 gaps, counted from problems in trace.json</span></span></dd></div><div class="kit-page-header__field"><dt>Snapshot SHA</dt><dd><code class="kit-page-header__mono">origin/main b394466</code></dd></div><div class="kit-page-header__field"><dt>Compiled at</dt><dd class="kit-page-header__stamp"><span class="kit-timestamp__stamp" data-state="instant"><time class="kit-timestamp__time" datetime="2026-10-19T17:45:08.000Z">2026-10-19 18:45:08 BST</time><button type="button" class="kit-timestamp__toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_r_a1_" aria-label="Show UTC time">UTC</button><span id="_r_a1_" class="kit-timestamp__utc" hidden=""><time class="kit-timestamp__time" datetime="2026-10-19T17:45:08.000Z">2026-10-19 17:45:08 UTC</time></span></spa