cyRequestBuilder defaults are copied from the api.md E1 request (api.md:98-105). They are type Household (SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs:12), start TestClock.Today+15 = 2026-11-01 (:13, with TestClock.cs:8), amount 365.00 (:14), autoRenew true (:15), paymentMethod DirectDebit (:16), address line 1 '1 High St' (:18), lines 2 and 3 null (:19-20) and postcode 'M1 1AA' (:21). The builder comment says as much at :23-24: 'differs from Build()'s defaults and from the api.md example (the two match)'. Rule (tdd-outside-in): 'Defaults never equal the api-contract example payloads (names, dates, amounts, address), so a stub canned from the example can't pass a test that sells the defaults.' requirements-trace item 5: 'builder defaults never equal the contract example'.</dd></div><div class="kit-finding-card__field"><dt>Files</dt><dd><a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Builders/SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Builders/SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primitive · line absent"><span class="kit-file-line-link__text">tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/Builders/SellPolicyRequestBuilder.cs</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link kit-file-line-link__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a> <a class="kit-file-line-link__link" href="https://github.com/dpmorgandev/uinsure-policies-api/blob/main/tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellTermLengthTests.cs" aria-label="tests/Uinsure.Policies.Api.Tests/SellTermLengthTests.cs on GitHub" data-line="absent" data-comp="file-line-link · primiti